--- planner: what stops a request
closed document: ok=false why='the document is not open or has no file path' entry= novusc=
scratch buffer: ok=false why='the document is not open or has no file path' entry= novusc=
project without main: ok=false why='the project has no entry file with a main method' entry= novusc=
